        {
          "text": "arababarira, ati Mushire imitima yanyu ku majambo yose mbabariye uyu musi, muze muyatoze abana banyu kugira ngo baze bitondere amajambo yose y’ivyo vyagezwe, babishitse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
