        {
          "text": "Ivyo ntimubigire ivyoroshe; kukw ari vyo bugingo bganyu, kandi ni mwavyitondera bizobahesha kurambira mu gihugu, ico mugiye kujabuka Yorodani ngo mucinjire.",
          "type": "text",
